# 统一换行符，避免跨平台协作时把脚本弄坏。
# 关键：gradlew 是 shell 脚本，必须保持 LF，否则 macOS / Linux 上无法执行。

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Unix 脚本明确 LF
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.so binary
*.onnx binary
*.zip binary

# 语言识别 / 差异统计
*.kt text
*.kts text
*.py text
*.md text
*.xml text
*.json text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.iss text
*.spec text
*.properties text
